# 行尾符策略：脚本必须 LF（CRLF 会让 shebang 失效、bash 报 $'\r': command not found）
*.sh                  text eol=lf
.githooks/pre-commit  text eol=lf
*.cmd                 text eol=crlf
*.bat                 text eol=crlf

# 二进制，避免被当文本做行尾转换
*.png                 binary
*.jpg                 binary
*.jpeg                binary
*.ico                 binary
*.exe                 binary
